---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
import { href } from '../lib';
---
<Base title="Disclaimer" description={`Investment disclaimer and disclosure policy for ${SITE.title}.`}>
  <article class="post prose">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Last updated: November 22, 2026</p>

    <h2>Not investment advice</h2>
    <p>All content on {SITE.title}, including articles, images, charts and linked videos, is for informational and
      educational purposes only. Nothing here is investment, financial, tax or legal advice, or a recommendation to buy,
      sell or hold any security. I am an individual investor, not a licensed financial advisor, broker or analyst.</p>

    <h2>Do your own research</h2>
    <p>Investing in stocks involves risk, including the possible loss of your entire investment. Past performance does not
      guarantee future results. Before making any investment decision, do your own research and consider speaking with a
      qualified professional who knows your personal situation.</p>

    <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
    <p>I base my analysis on company filings, investor presentations and other public sources, and I try to note the date
      for every figure. Even so, information can be incomplete, become outdated or contain errors. I don't guarantee the
      accuracy or completeness of anything on this site. If you spot a mistake, please <a href={href('contact/')}>let me know</a>
      and I'll correct it.</p>

    <h2>My positions</h2>
    <p>I often write about stocks I own. When I hold a position in a stock discussed in an article, I say so in that
      article. My positions can change at any time without notice, and owning a stock does not mean you should.</p>

    <h2>Compensation and advertising</h2>
    <p>I am not paid by any company I write about. This site may display ads (for example, from Google AdSense) and may
      in the future include affiliate links, which would be clearly labeled. Advertisers have no influence over what I write.</p>

    <h2>Opinions</h2>
    <p>Opinions expressed here are my own and do not represent the views of my employer or any other organization.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>By using this site you agree that {SITE.title} and its author are not liable for any losses or damages arising from
      your use of, or reliance on, the information provided here.</p>

    <p>Questions? See the <a href={href('contact/')}>Contact page</a>. See also our <a href={href('privacy/')}>Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
